    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nThis 2 storey family home positioned on this very popular road close to the conveniences of a corner shop, post office and a hairdresser. No.80 Ballymun Road a family home which offers potential to extend to the side (subject to planning permission). The accommodation comprises a large hallway with under stairs storage, there are two reception rooms, the living room to the front with bay window and tiled fireplace, the dining room is similar and leads the breakfast room with the kitchen off it. Upstairs there are four spacious bedrooms, three doubles and a single room with a family bathroom and wc completing the accommodation. \n \nThrough the front gate is off street parking along with a small garden area. The rear garden in enclosed and features storage and garden area. \n \nThe location is simply superb within close distance of the city centre and convenient to the numerous shops, cafes, bars and restaurants both Drumcondra and Phibsborough villages have to offer. The Botanic Gardens and Griffith Park are moments away and provide beautiful open green areas. Dublin City University is within easy walking distance and with a variety of sports clubs including Na Fianna, a great selection of national and secondary schools locally. The Four Courts, King's Inns, Beaumont Hospital and the Mater Hospital are all within easy reach. Commuting further afield is made very easy with the M50 Motorway, the M1 and Dublin Airport within a few minutes' drive. The area is very well serviced by public transport, through the many bus routes which pass close by.\n\nIf you would like a viewing of this property, please email us at Drumcondra@sherryfitz.ie or call the office directly on 018373737 to arrange an appointment. If you wish to place an offer, please visit www.sherryfitz.ie where you can register to make an offer on this property."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 4.36m x 1.89m\nWelcoming entrance hall with wood flooring, ceiling coving and rose.\n\nLiving Room - 3.92m x 3.72m\nTo the front of the property with feature bay window, open fireplace, ceiling coving and rose, and sliding door to dining room.\n\nDining Room - 3.94m x 3.92m\nTo the rear of the property with open fireplace, ceiling coving and rose, sliding doors to living room, and door to rear garden.\n\nKitchen - 3.52m x 2.42m\nWith wall and floor units, door to garage and door to rear garden.\n\nBreakfast Room - 3.62m x 2.86m\nWith wood flooring and open fireplace.\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.00m x 3.44m\nLarge double bedroom to the front of the property with bay window and fireplace.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.92m x 3.02m\nDouble bedroom to the rear of the property with carpet flooring and fireplace.\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.64m x 2.52m\nSpacious bedroom to the front of the property.\n\nBedroom 4 - 2.86m x 2.02m\nSpacious bedroom to the rear of the property.\n\nBathroom - 3.02m x 1.86m\nWth wash hand basin and bath.\n\nWC - 1.86m x 0.86m\nWith wc.\n\n"
      },
